<ContentPage title="Return & Refund Policy" metaTitle="Return & Refund Policy | Konarkini" description="Review Konarkini's current return and refund information for children's clothing and future online orders." path="/return-refund-policy/" eyebrow="Clear and considered"><h2>Current status</h2><p>Because the website does not currently accept orders or payments, there are no online purchases eligible for return, exchange, or refund.</p><h2>Future policy</h2><p>Before sales open, we will publish clear eligibility windows, product-condition requirements, exchange options, refund timing, and instructions for damaged or incorrect items.</p><h2>Need help?</h2><p>For questions about a purchase made through any authorised offline channel, contact us with your purchase details so the relevant terms can be confirmed.</p></ContentPage>
